    "sha256": "81ca4960861bd4225bd99e52d1b73fa11dac40eeca0f86c0ceaf328029be544b",
    "content": "\n\\frac{n^2}{6}+\\frac n2-\\Big[\\frac{(p+q)^2}{6}+\\frac p2+b_1\\Big]\n=\n\\frac{b_1^2+|I_0|^2+2b_1|I_0|+2(b_1+|I_0|)(p+q)+3|I_0|+3q-3b_1}{6}.\n",
